  "description": "Gangsta rap: the hardcore hip hop of the 90s at 84 to 96 BPM, built on samples: a hard, dusty break, a menacing minor piano or string loop from an old film score chopped and crushed, low strings that hang under it, a sub that follows the kick, a high eerie piano note now and then, vinyl crackle, three verses and hooks",
